        "privacy.title": "Buleto Privacy Policy",
        "privacy.description": "Regardless of whether you are our current or former customer, or just a visitor of this site, the privacy of all our users is our main concern.",
        "privacy.heading": "Privacy Policy",
        "privacy.paragraph_0": "<p>Regardless of whether you are our current or former customer, or just a visitor of this site, the privacy of all our users is our main concern.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_1": "<p>1 . Providing to the company your personal data, such as full name, postal address, passport or driver's license number, etc., you fully agree that the company can collect, use, store and protect the information presented in the order described below.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_2": "<p>The Company will collect personal information from customers in the following circumstances:</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_2_1": "<p>2.1 When opening a fully functional trading account or its demo version (when filling out electronic registration forms) on the Company's website.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_2_2": "<p>2.2 When depositing your personal trading account.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_2_3": "<p>2.3 When withdrawing funds from personal trading account.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_3": "<p>3. Personal data that can be collected includes:</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_3_1": "<p>3.1 Personal information, for example, full name, address, date of birth, ID number and occupation.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_3_2": "<p>3.2 Financial information, for example, data on assets, experience in investment and monthly income, in order to assess your progress in trade.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_3_3": "<p>3.3 Deposit to your account or withdrawing funds from it, we can request documents, such as a digital copy of identification document, copy of utility bill, copy of the card with the last 4 figures and extract from the bank account.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_4": "<p>4. Customers voluntary provide to the company personal information collected by one of the following ways, in the following cases:</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_4_1": "<p>4.1 When filling out electronic registration forms on the Company's website or on the Company's mini-website(s).</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_4_2": "<p>4.2 When making deposits to the trading account or withdrawing funds from the account, customers voluntary provide necessary documents.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_4_3": "<p>4.3 When trading with the use of the Company\u2019s system.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_4_4": "<p>4.4 When contacting the company or responding to advertisement.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_5": "<p>5. There is certain information that the Company indirectly collects, such as IP addresses, information about the operating system used, software configuration and the use of cookies.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_6": "<p>6. The Company will use information received from customers for the following purposes:</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_6_1": "<p>6.1 To identify the customer.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_6_2": "<p>6.2 For setting up, maintaining and managing trading accounts of customers.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_6_3": "<p>6.3 To process deposits and withdrawals in the customer's personal trading account.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_6_4": "<p>6.4 To keep customers informed on news, updates and new promotions.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_6_5": "<p>6.5 To analyze customer activity in order to improve and provide the best products and services for customers.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_6_6": "<p>6.6 To provide customers with the best quality support.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_7": "<p>7 . The Company does not transfer any information of the customer to any affiliated persons or third parties. Only under the following circumstances personal information of the customer can be transferred:</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_7_1": "<p>7.1 In order to open, maintain and manage your personal trading account, the Company may exchange information with service providers such as lawyers, accountants, auditors, and other financial professionals.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_7_2": "<p>7.2 In order to prevent fraud, money laundering, unauthorized transactions, as well as material claims.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_7_3": "<p>7.3 The Company may exchange information with affiliated persons and brokers, mainly with a view to calculating compensation due to these parties.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_8": "<p>8 . References</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_8_1": "<p>8.1 Links to other (external) websites can be found on the Company's website. The Company is not responsible for content of external websites and advises all customers to read the privacy policy of external websites before sending any personal information.</p>",
        "privacy.paragraph_8_2": "<p>8.2 The Company's privacy policy applies only to information collected by the Company.</p>",
        "privacy.laundry.heading": "<h4>Anti-Money Laundering</h4>",
        "privacy.laundry.paragraph_1": "<p>The Company and the Customer are obliged to follow anti-money laundering laws and regulations applicable worldwide, as well as local regulations. The customer should know and confirm that:</p>",
        "privacy.laundry.paragraph_2": "<p>Use of the website and services of the Company by the Customer is possible only in compliance with applicable law and is not intended for any criminal activity.</p>",
        "privacy.laundry.paragraph_3": "<p>All transfers of money to/from the Customer should comply with anti-money laundering laws and regulations. The origin of funds that the customer transfers to the company should not be related to any criminal or any other illegal activity.</p>",
        "privacy.laundry.paragraph_4": "<p>The customer should provide true and up-to-date information about himself/herself so that the company can identify the Customer at receipt and transfer of funds to/from the Customer.</p>",
        "privacy.laundry.paragraph_5": "<p>All payments by the Company to the Customer are processed in the same currency and to the same bank account / credit card from which these funds were initially transferred, unless the Company decides, at its discretion, to transfer these funds to another account of the Customer.</p>",
