        "training.text": 'Buleto provides free individual training for those who wishing to learn about options trading and Forex market. Please call us at <a href="tel:+0312979700">0312 97-97-00</a> to arrange time and training venue. You can pre-select a venue convenient for you from the list of Buleto trading halls:',
