        "about.title": "About Buleto",
        "about.description": "Buleto provides a unique platform for financial trading in the Forex market and binary options, presenting a wide range of financial assets.",
        "about.head": "About us",
        "about.paragraph_1": "<h4>Giving Traders Endless Possibilities</h4>",
        "about.paragraph_2": "<p>Buleto is today\u2019s leading binary options trading platform. As binary options have become more popular than ever, Buleto provides traders with an excellent trader experience in terms of security, features, user-friendliness, tools, and education.</p>",
        "about.paragraph_3": "<p>Buleto commits to excellence in providing a trading platform that can be used for private and institutional investors worldwide. The staff at Buleto is there for traders 24/7, with professional brokers guiding traders every step of the way.</p>",
        "about.paragraph_4": "<h4>Benefits of the buleto platform:</h4>",
        "about.paragraph_5": "<ol><li>Web-based, no downloading necessary </li> <li>Simple trading \u2014 easy to understand with clear explanations</li> <li>Diverse products</li> <li>User friendly trading experience</li> <li>Safe \u2014 clear risk/profit ratios stated in option</li> <li>Quick and easy deposits/withdrawals</li> </ol>",
        "about.paragraph_6": "<p>Our vision is to give you, the trader, the safest, most convenient, and all around best trading experience every. Our pricing and execution modules ensure the use of the most updated and advanced technologies. Through our partnership with feeds provider, we receive live and accurate data streams, and our terms and conditions clearly state the difference between real time market price, and option prices. We provide expiry graphs for any given moment, to ensure trader confidence so there are never any questions on the trader\u2019s end.</p>",
        "about.paragraph_7": "<p>Client's funds are held in a segregated account. Funds are used only for trading options through our website upon client\u2019s instructions and are never used for any other cause. Our liabilities and exposures are professionally handled and we guarantee payouts of your profits based on our terms.</p>",
        "about.paragraph_8": "<p>Buleto and its partners have a team of professional forex brokers, experts in derivatives and risk management. We cover every aspect of binary options trading, so that you have the best trader experience. Ever.</p>",
        "about.paragraph_9": "<h4>Join the Buleto family, and trade like a professional!</h4>",
